    "note": "Two versions. Later version read: Amended 2022-08-25 (Assembly/Senate concurrence votes 1224988, 1225316, 1225317). Earlier version: Introduced 2022-02-03, on which the Senate's first vote (1189300) was taken; it differs: it was a cross-reference spot bill, 'This bill would update cross references' in Penal Code 30370 and 30470 only, e.g. 'as described in Section 28225, as it read on December 31, 2019,' replacing 'Section 28225' (struck/added), with none of the carry-license or sensitive-place parts. Amended text also changes 171b, 171d, 171.5, 171.7, 626.9 (Gun-Free School Zone Act), 25350 (severability), 25610, 25850, 26155-26195, 26205-26225, 26350, 26400 (not quoted). Urgency statute. Includes AB 2239 coordination for Penal Code 29805."
